:: "I'm Tank Flintlock."
/* TK */ Benny: "Tank Flintlock! That's a heck of a name. Do you prefer Tank? Or Flintlock?"

[["Call me Tank."|Moving On]]
[["Call me Flintlock."|Moving On][$player.pref to "Flintlock"]]
[["I said Tank Flintlock."|Moving On][$player.pref to "Tank Flintlock"]]


:: Come up with alias.
/*
Need to add form validation
*/
"What's your first name?" <<textbox "$player.first" $player.first>>

"What's your last name?" <<textbox "$player.last" $player.last>>

"What do you prefer to be called?" <<textbox "$player.pref" $player.pref>>

<<button "Tell Benny" "Moving On">>
<<set $player.full to $player.first.trim() + " " + $player.last.trim() >>
<</button>>

:: Moving On
"$player.pref it is!"

"That's my name. Don't wear it out."

[[Off we go.]]